            <title>[ZEPPELIN-315] Zengine test (notebook/scheduler) can fail (time-dependency)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-315</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Occasionally running Zengine tests results in a failure, because an assertEquals fails, as updating the conf takes longer than it took cron to start another iteration. See the attached PR for more details.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
