                            <comment id="14952211" author="githubbot" created="Sun, 11 Oct 2015 08:19:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user Leemoonsoo commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/315#issuecomment-147171849&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/315#issuecomment-147171849&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    The test case was intended to test, &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    1) create a paragraph&lt;br/&gt;
    2) set cron expression and wait for paragraph finishes. to verify cron scheduler work.&lt;br/&gt;
    3) remove cron expression and wait some time, to verify removing cron scheduler works and paragraph is no longer executed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    I think this PR does not validate 3) &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14952221" author="githubbot" created="Sun, 11 Oct 2015 08:56:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user RPCMoritz commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

